  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: 'The first thing you notice as you enter your room is that the window is
      open. You cannot recall leaving it open when you left this morning, so the
      chilly breeze entering the room catches you by surprise. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: "The second \u2013 and even more baffling \u2013 thing you notice is that
      there is a black cat sitting on your desk by the window. You do not own a cat.
      Your room is on the second floor. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: 'What the-? How did you even get in here Kitty? '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: "Gingerly, you approach the cat like one would a dangerous wild animal.
      The cat does not move, only continues to stare at you with unimpressed feline
      eyes. Once you get close enough you notice a sheet of paper under its paw.
      Letting out a curious noise, you slowly reach out a hand, grasping the edge
      of the foreign note and carefully attempt to dislodge it from underneath the
      cat\u2019s paw. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: I do not recall giving you permission to touch, human.
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: You rear back with an undignified shriek at the sudden voice, whipping
      around to see who entered your room without your notice, only to find no one
      there. The room is as empty as ever, the only living beings inside it were
      you and the cat. You let out a quiet breath, shaking your head. Maybe all that
      sleep was messing with you.
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 2
    kind: 0
    text: There really is no need for such dramatics. You did not even hear what
      this one had to say yet.
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: 'You once again look around the room with wild eyes. You fear your neck
      is going to snap because of the quick motions. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 2
    kind: 0
    text: 'Over here, child. Right in front of you. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: The voice had taken on an exasperated tone, and you slowly turn your sight
      toward it to... the cat? Indeed, the cat sitting on your desk in front of you
      nods its head as if satisfied. What the fuck??
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: Good. Now, as this one was about to say before you had your little freak
      out, this one has-
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "This \u2018little freakout\u2019 is far from over, thank you! How the
      fuck are you talking? Talking cats don\u2019t exist! *muble* No wait, maybe
      it\u2019s one of those lifelike robots? Is this a prank? *loudly* Haha, good
      one guys! You really got me! You can come out now! \u2026Guys?"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: "Only awkward silence follows your words, the cats sleek tail flickering
      in irritation. If it is a robot, then the people that built it surely have
      an eye for detail and realism. A growl of reprimand rumbled out of the cat,
      and you flinch back slightly, afraid it\u2019s going to try and scratch you."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "You keep on interrupting me. I do not condone disrespect like that; do
      not let it happen again. You claim that talking cats don\u2019t exist, yet
      here I am sitting before you."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: "The cat\u2019s eyes sharpen into an expression of slyness"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "Hmm, if I\u2019d known you are this doubting of the supernatural, I would
      have found another human to quest with aiding this ghost. Truly a shame.. But
      this one supposes she will have to search for another."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: "The word \u2018ghost\u2019 makes you freeze where you stand. A ghost?
      An actual real life ghost? As in dead soul, trapped and unable to move on ghost?
      That was.. so cool! A ghosthunting quest!- A chuckle interrupts your train
      of thought, and as you look at the feline, it looked like the cat that got
      the cream. Ah, had you said all that out loud?"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: Ah yes, this is more the reaction this one expected when she heard that
      you are fond of ghost stories. But well, you have already made it clear that
      you do not wish to lend your aid in this matter, so this one will leave now.
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: The cat makes a move to get up, so you quickly interrupt her with a desperate
      half-shout.
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: No no no, wait! I want to do it! Me! Ill help you!
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: 'A sigh of relief escapes your lips as the cat sits back down on her haunches.
      The paw resting on the piece of paper finally moves off of it, and she nods
      to it, as if signalling you to take it. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: 'Very well, then this one shall explain the matter to you. The most condensed
      version of this story would be that someone died in this school. Their body
      has not been discovered yet, so the other residents of this school do not know. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: 'Very well, then this one shall explain the matter to you. The most condensed
      version of this story would be that someone died in this school. Their body
      has not been discovered yet, so the other residents of this school do not know. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: 'That certainly came as a shock. Of course, you knew that the whole concept
      of a ghost entailed someone dying, but hearing that there is supposedly an
      actual corpse hidden somewhere in school sends an icy shiver down your spine.
      If the cat noticed your moment of anxiety, she chose not to mention it. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "The problem is \u2013 as I\u2019m sure you can already guess \u2013 that
      their soul got stuck here in the mortal plane. Perhaps it is an unfulfilled
      wish, perhaps it is regret or hatred that is keeping them chained to this school.
      Or perhaps they simply do not want to believe that they are dead. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: 'Whatever it is, it is keeping them from moving on. That is where you come
      into play. You have to help this lost soul move on, for if they do not make
      peace with themselves within three days, they will be trapped here for all
      of eternity. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "But how am I supposed to do that? I don\u2019t even know who died, let
      alone what kinda problems they had. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: 'This one is afraid that that is for you to figure out, little one. This
      cat cannot interfere beyond her own jurisdiction. She can only guide you in
      the right direction. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: The cat looks up at the moon hanging high in the sky, the cool light seeming
      to give her black fur an almost otherworldly glow. She stood up and walked
      the few steps over to the window.
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: This one must go. Everything I just explained to you is also written on
      this note. I recommend you tuck into a notebook so that you may keep track
      of all the clues and important information you have gathered. Shall you ever
      need me, I will be there. Good luck, child.
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: "You look down to pick up the note from the desk, and when you raise your
      eyes again, the dark cat is gone. You stand in silence for a few minutes, trying
      to comprehend what just happened. Eventually, you wordlessly pick up an empty
      notebook from your desk and place the cat\u2019s piece of paper inside it. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: "You still have no idea where to even start looking for a ghost, so maybe
      it was time to think of a plan. After working it over in your brain time and
      time again, you finally decide to try and find clues during the day. After
      all, even if the students don\u2019t yet know of the death, surely someone
      would have noticed at least something? And at night, you will sneak back into
      the school to investigate the building itself. Well, that seemed like a sound
      plan, to your ears. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 2
    text: 'Satisfied, you nod to yourself, before finally getting ready to sleep.
      It will be a important day tomorrow, after all.  '
    videoEventId: 
